{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38901","headline":"酬张员外见寄 · 杜荀鹤","name":"酬张员外见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分应天与吟诗老，如此兵戈不废诗。\n生在世间人不识，死於泉下鬼应知。\n啼花蜀鸟春同苦，叫雪巴猿昼共饥。\n今日逢君惜分手，一枝何校一年迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}